Map {
  "1.0.0.0" => "Help! Monsters!",
  "1.0.1.0" => "Cia, leave that fairy alone! It hasn't hurt
anybody!",
  "1.0.2.0" => "I should have guessed that you'd be
protecting the fairies. Foolish, Lana.",
  "1.0.3.0" => "We're no match for Cia and her forces
here. Let's send to Hyrule Castle for help!",
  "1.0.4.0" => "We can't take on the whole Hyrulean army
yet! Don't let them reach the castle!",
  "1.0.5.0" => "We'll go get help!",
  "1.0.6.0" => "Capture one of those keeps, and force the
gates open!",
  "1.0.7.0" => "What do we do? I don't know how to fight
monsters!",
  "1.0.8.0" => "You go hide with the others. I'll take care
of these guys!",
  "1.0.9.0" => "Everybody there in the north! Hurry!",
  "1.0.10.0" => "Cia, this is outrageous and I WILL stop
you. You'll see!",
  "1.0.11.0" => "Don't let them take another step!",
  "1.0.12.0" => "They've escaped. We can expect the
Hyrulean army soon.",
  "1.0.13.0" => "Ha! You can't run from me!",
  "1.0.14.0" => "That's enough. We did well.",
  "1.0.15.0" => "Ugh. More than half of them escaped...",
  "1.0.16.0" => "How can you call yourselves monsters
when you can't kill ONE measly Goron?!",
  "1.0.17.0" => "They made it! The Hyruleans will come to
help--just hold tight a little longer!",
  "1.0.18.0" => "Bah. Fairies, armies of humans--they're all
the same to me. I can kill anything!",
  "1.0.19.0" => "Where did all these creatures come from?
And how did they appear so suddenly?",
  "1.0.20.0" => "The princess! Never mind the fairies! All
forces, kill Zelda!",
  "1.0.21.0" => "Onward! For Hyrule!",
  "1.0.22.0" => "How cute--the mice have organized a
rebellion against the cats.",
  "1.0.23.0" => "Hmm. I'm not sure my soldiers can handle
this many... I'd better get involved directly.",
  "1.0.24.0" => "Is that a general joining the battle? Taking
her down will lure out the princess...",
  "1.0.25.0" => "Blast it! I've failed you, Your Highness. I
have to fall back.",
  "1.0.26.0" => "If General Impa had to retreat, what hope
do the rest of us have?",
  "1.0.27.0" => "The fairies are safe now. I just hope the
Hyrulean troops defeat the monster army!",
  "1.0.28.0" => "These soldiers are all bark and no bite. I'll
leave it to you--try to enjoy yourselves.",
  "1.0.29.0" => "I will not sit idly by! When Hyrule is
threatened, we all must answer the call!",
  "1.0.30.0" => "Princess Zelda has taken the field! We
must defend Her Royal Highness!",
  "1.0.31.0" => "...",
  "1.0.32.0" => "What are you doing here, trainee? It's too
dangerous--get back to the castle!",
  "1.0.33.0" => "The princess? And she can hold her own, I
see. I'll have to test her mettle...",
  "1.0.34.0" => "Soldiers of Hyrule! I seek a worthy foe!
Bring me your greatest warrior!",
  "1.0.35.0" => "That knight is different than the others...
We'll have to deal with him carefully.",
  "1.0.36.0" => "Stop! You c-c-cannot pass!",
  "1.0.37.0" => "Careful! She'ssss strong!",
  "1.0.38.0" => "He's amazing... Could he be...",
  "1.0.39.0" => "Don't lose hope, friends!",
  "1.0.40.0" => "It will be our honor to fight at your side,
Princess Zelda! ",
  "1.0.41.0" => "For Hyrule and peace in our time!",
  "1.0.42.0" => "For Hyrule!",
  "1.0.43.0" => "Keep fighting, everyone! We mustn't lose!",
  "1.0.44.0" => "If Her Highness won't give up, we can't
give up, either!",
  "1.0.45.0" => "...!",
  "1.0.46.0" => "No! We should withdraw from this area,
friends. We'll regroup and return later.",
  "1.0.47.0" => "Rude! They went to their castle and didn't
invite us! Guess we'll just have to knock!",
  "1.0.48.0" => "I didn't take them seriously enough, I
suppose. We'll just have to start over...",
  "1.0.49.0" => "Hmph. I underestimated them.",
  "1.0.50.0" => "It can't end like this...",
  "1.0.51.0" => "They escaped...",
  "1.0.52.0" => "What do we do now?! There's so many of
them!",
  "1.0.53.0" => "Khh... We can't afford to lose just yet...
Quickly, rally the troops! Strike back!",
  "1.0.54.0" => "All hands, to arms! Anyone who can hold a
weapon, rally on my position!",
  "1.0.55.0" => "We're in trouble! Everyone's
got to hurry!",
  "1.0.56.0" => "The plan seems to have worked.
Now it's time to play my part!",
  "1.0.57.0" => "We're marching out as well!
That base is as good as ours!",
  "1.0.58.0" => "How did we fail? It's inconceivable...",
  "1.0.59.0" => "Our plan didn't work, but we
can't just run away!",
  "1.0.60.0" => "Lady Impa...? No! Without our
commander, we're lost!",
  "13.0.0.0" => "Hiya ha ha! Take the keep and force those
gates open!",
  "13.0.1.0" => "What are you doing, fools?! If any more
escape, they'll do it over your dead bodies!",
  "13.0.2.0" => "You let them get away?! Imbeciles! Useless
pests!",
  "13.0.3.0" => "So you came running when those escapees
called you? How nauseatingly noble!",
  "13.0.4.0" => "What kind of princess fights alongside the
commoners? I'll teach her some manners!",
  "13.0.5.0" => "First the castle...then the owner... I'll
murder it all! Me! Hiya ha ha!",
  "13.0.6.0" => "The wizard is a real threat. Keep your
guard up, everyone!",
  "13.0.7.0" => "They took our base? You wretches! Now
we have to start from scratch!",
  "13.0.8.0" => "Hmph. At least you're good at running
away...",
  "13.0.9.0" => "No! We can't let that monster get ahead
of us!",
  "13.0.10.0" => "Princess Zelda! Forgive me! The enemy
led me right into their trap...",
  "13.0.11.0" => "We should be able to push the enemy back.
Come! There isn't a moment to wait!",
  "13.0.12.0" => "Impa, are you really hurt?",
  "13.0.13.0" => "Are you...one of the trainees?",
  "13.0.14.0" => "Princess, we must capture the Central and
Eastern Keeps and close the north gates!",
  "13.0.15.0" => "I'll prepare our battle plan. Princess, please
lead the troops on your siege of the keeps!",
  "13.0.16.0" => "The enemy has forced itself into the north.
We need the Great Fairy's help now...",
  "13.0.17.0" => "If our plan succeeds, we'll cripple their force
all at once! Come! To the Fairy Fountain!",
  "13.0.18.0" => "If we had some bombs, we could probably
break open the Fairy Fountain's gate...",
  "13.0.19.0" => "Hurry over here! Blow up the Fairy
Fountain's gate and get inside!",
  "13.0.20.0" => "Take caution, everyone. The enemy is
attacking from the north!",
  "13.0.21.0" => "What? The East Field Keep has been taken?",
  "13.0.22.0" => "Over here! We have to pray to the Great Fairy
together!",
  "13.0.23.0" => "Princess, the plan was successful! The
enemy has been greatly diminished!",
  "13.0.24.0" => "Princess Zelda, the plan worked wonderfully!
The enemy has suffered huge losses!",
  "13.0.25.0" => "Impa, fall back and regroup our forces!",
  "13.0.26.0" => "Understood. And, Princess--be careful!",
  "13.0.27.0" => "We managed to pull through... Well done,
everyone! This victory belongs to you!",
  "13.0.28.0" => "Princess Zelda, horrible news! The enemy
wizard has taken over the castle!",
  "13.0.29.0" => "We have to protect Hyrule! C'mon, Link!
Let's go!",
  "13.0.30.0" => "With this, I could destroy those boulders and
reach Impa...",
  "13.0.31.0" => "Princess Zelda! Use this! It should help
increase the impact of your bombs!",
  "13.0.32.0" => "Princess Zelda... I've failed you...",
  "13.0.33.0" => "The boulders are keeping us from getting to
Impa... What are we supposed to do?",
  "13.0.34.0" => "Link, look! I can see the princess!",
}